cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pySUTO, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pySUTO: Python-based Supply-Use Table Optimiser"
abstract: >-
  pySUTO reconciles supply-use tables from conflicting sources: a sigma-weighted
  quadratic programme, solved with Clarabel, returns the flows that agree with the
  accounting constraints at the smallest weighted distance from the data, and the
  posterior uncertainty of every flow.
authors:
